<h2 id="sec-9">Governing Law</h2>
<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United States, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>

<h2 id="sec-10">Contact</h2>
<p>For questions about these Terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:legal@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">legal@10bestliving.com</a>.</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


